 md=f'# {app["name"]} — motion and interaction direction\n\nJason Festa / WDA · 21 October 2026\n\n{shared["status"]}\n\n## {d["title"]}\n\n**Production approach:** {d["method"]}.\n\n{d["overview"]}\n\n“VO” is interpreted here as Veo for motion-reference studies; no voiceover or audio is planned. Soul, Petal and Daybook use the programmatic production approaches specified below.\n\n[Full control ledger](../{app["id"]}.md) · [Visual review](../../reviews/{app["id"]}.html#motion) · [Implementation prompt](../../{m["prompt_path"]})\n\n## Reference chain\n\n[Original art direction](../../references/originals/{app["original"]}.png) → [archived research](../../research/archive/mobile-research-2026-10-20.md) → [current product findings](../../research/README.md) → the five approved PNGs below → this proposed motion contract. Reference findings and WDA design decisions are distinguished; no competitor interaction is claimed to have been copied from a verified native recording.\n\n'
 for x in m['references']:md+=f'- [{x["title"]}]({x["url"]}) — {x["finding"]}\n'
